# Deployment archives only. `export-ignore` affects `git archive` and nothing
# else (never checkout, clone, or builds).
#
# The Azure App Service zip is built with `git archive HEAD:backend`
# (see deploy/azure.md). These paths are not needed at runtime and would
# otherwise make every deploy upload 27 MB instead of ~130 KB:
#   media/  - legacy local sample files; real uploads go to Google Drive
#   tests/  - the suite never runs on the server
media/ export-ignore
tests/ export-ignore
requirements-test.txt export-ignore
